<ansi fg="black-bold">.:</ansi> <ansi fg="magenta">Help for </ansi><ansi fg="skill">bronze-short-sword</ansi> (blacksmithing recipe)

A short sword of bronze, against iron: damage x0.95, speed x1.0, weight
x1.1. Bronze is nearly as good as iron and handsome with it, if a little
heavier.

