  <ansi fg="yellow">Skill:</ansi>       blacksmithing (minimum 10)
  <ansi fg="yellow">Station:</ansi>     forge
  <ansi fg="yellow">Ingredients:</ansi> bronze ingot (x2), leather strip (x1)

